# ==============================================================================
# Qrie AI Platform — Comprehensive .gitignore
# Covers Node.js (Fastify Backend, Next.js Web App), Flutter (Android App),
# Supabase Edge Functions, IDEs, and OS artifacts.
# ==============================================================================

# Node.js & Web (Backend & Web-App)
**/node_modules/
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Next.js & TypeScript Build Outputs
**/.next/
.next/
**/dist/
dist/
**/out/
out/
**/build/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts.bak

# Test & Coverage Caches
**/coverage/
coverage/
**/.vitest/
.vitest/
**/.turbo/
.turbo/
**/.cache/
.cache/

# Environment Variables & Secrets (CRITICAL)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
*.pem
*.key
*.cert

# Flutter & Dart (Android App)
**/.dart_tool/
.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/build/
**/app/build/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/app/build/
**/android/captures/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/Podfile.lock

# IDEs & Editors
.idea/
**/.idea/
*.iml
**/*.iml
.vscode/
**/.vscode/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# OS Artifacts
